ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Miranda Morehouse, speaking.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Good afternoon, Ms. Morehouse. This is Farmani \u2013 CEO of Holly's. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Oh, hello Mr. Farmani. Glad to finally have a chance to speak with you. I've heard so much about you."}, {"time": "13000", "image": "engenn6le04ob05re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: All good things I hope. So, Ms. Morehouse, what is this about?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Well, I heard through the grapevine that Holly's is looking into hiring a PR agency. Would you mind telling me more about it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Not at all. Holly's is a mid-range chain of department stores with more than 300 stores across North America. Because we are growing fast, we are looking into hiring a PR agency to manage our image as well as creating publicity for our new clothing line."}, {"time": "39000", "image": "engenn6le04ob05re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Oh, that sounds great. Could you possibly tell me more about it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Sure. This PR agency will play a role in managing our company's communication with the media and helping us organize special events to promote our clothes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: It sounds very exciting. I am sure Polygon and I, personally, are prepared for deadlines and the long hours expected to put in with a PR job.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I'm glad to hear that. Do you mind sending me a proposal with your visions and ideas?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Absolutely. We have experienced professionals that can definitely help you and your company. Thank you for your time, Mr. Farmani. Bye for now."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter's New Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Meeting Farmani"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le04ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making And Responding To Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When talking to people you know or do not know, it is important to be polite when you ask for something. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can make requests by using: "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Can you ...?</li> <li>Could you ... ?</li> <li>Will you ... ? </li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>Do you mind ... ? </li> <li>Is it OK if I ... ?</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can respond to requests by saying: "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Sure, here you are.</li> <li>Absolutely.</li> <li>Okay. </li> <li>Not at all. </li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Things to remember when making a request</span><br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "\u201cWould you mind ... ?\u201d and \u201cDo you mind ... ?\u201d are followed by <span class=\"italic\"> \u2018verb + -ing'</span><br/>\u201cCan  you ... ?\u201d, \u201cCould you ... ?\u201d, \u201cWill you ... ?\u201d, \u201cIs it OK if I ... ?\u201d are followed by a <span class=\"italic\">base form verb</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Do you mind</span> send<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> me the reports?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Not at all.  </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Could you tell me</span> a bit more about it? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Absolutely</span>. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Starting And Ending A Phone Conversation "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " It is common that English speakers make phone calls either for business purposes or personal reasons. These are expressions you can use when have conversations on the phone. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Answering the phone</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Introducing yourself</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Hello? (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span>)</li> <li>Thank you for calling Polygon. How can I help you?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Hey Giorgio. It's Marie calling. (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span>)</li> <li>Hello, this is Janet Ellison calling.</li> <li>Hi, it's Farmani from Holly's here.</li> <li>This is she *</li> <li>Speaking *</li></ul> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">(You say this when the caller is asking for you or does not recognize your voice)</li>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Asking to speak to someone</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Connecting someone </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Is Janet in? (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span></span>) <li>Is Janet there, please? (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span></span>) <li>Could I speak to Janet, please? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Just a sec. I'll get him (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span>)</li> <li>Hang on a second. </li> <li>Please hold.</li> <li>One moment please.\\t</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Making special requests</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Ending a conversation</span>  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Could you please repeat that?</li> <li>Would you mind telling me more about that? </li> <li>Can you call me back? I think we have a bad connection. </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <ul><li>Thanks for calling. Bye for now.</li> <li>I'll talk to you again soon. Bye. </li> <li>I have to let you go now.</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "CEO"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "short for Chief Executive Officer, the person with the most authority in a large company "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This is Mr.Farmani, CEO of Holly's."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when talking on the phone in the workplace. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "agency"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a business that provides a particular service for people or organizations"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Holly's is looking into hiring a PR agency."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mid-range"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not the most expensive or the cheapest "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We offer a mid-range of clothing. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a number of shops owned or managed by the same  person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are more than 300 stores in our chain."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "department store"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large shop that is divided into separate departments, each selling a different type of goods"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are a mid-range chain of department stores."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to look into"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to try to find out about something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are looking into hiring a PR firm."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob05aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to play a role"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have an influence on something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: We want a PR firm that will play a role in managing our company's communication. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob05aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "proposal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a plan which is presented to a company to consider"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you mind sending me a proposal with your ideas?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob05aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (70-80 words) about a phone conversation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use expressions to start a phone conversation. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Within the phone conversation, include a request and a response to that request. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember to use phrases to keep the conversation going and to the end the conversation. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice reading the dialogue aloud with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I start and end a conversation on the phone. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make and respond to requests on the phone."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use phrases to keep the conversation going."}]}]}